  "title": "Particular partition",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "97072e4d-cd76-4860-9069-f1db4ef39698",
      "text": "A particular partition divides the states of a system into external, sensory, active and internal states. The sensory and active states form the Markov blanket, and a particle (a thing) is its internal states together with its blanket.",
